# Derived, regenerable artifacts (fits, reports, backtests) — not tracked.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# ...but ALWAYS keep queried odds snapshots. Live markets settle and can
# never be re-fetched, so every query is archived here as a permanent,
# timestamped record (small JSON). This is the odds history to go back to.
!data/odds_*.json

# Never commit credentials or certs (they live in ~/.betfair anyway).
*.pem
*.crt
*.key
credentials.yaml
